    "norm": "Verifies that nesting two {@link FilterListIterator}s composes their predicates. <p>The inner iterator keeps only multiples of 3; the outer iterator then keeps only the even ones among those — leaving exactly the multiples of 6. {@link #walkLists} exercises all bidirectional traversal patterns against the plain {@code sixes} list as the authoritative reference."
   },
